## Next Steps for Deployment
1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Analytics section)
3. Verify analytics data collection by checking browser Network tab for `/_vercel/insights/view` requests
4. Monitor the Vercel dashboard for incoming analytics data after user traffic

## Notes
- The Analytics component is lightweight and will not impact application performance
- Data collection only begins after enabling Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard
- The implementation follows the official documentation retrieved from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart
- All existing functionality and code structure has been preserved
